Falsifies `system_tests::user::process_tests::a_member_stranded_killed_on_a_futex_is_finished_and_reaped`.

Architecture: aarch64, riscv64, x86_64

The defect, in milestone 812 (`std::thread::spawn` runs real threads in one address space)'s process
object: the sweep after a departing member's reap no longer finishes a member left parked and killed,
so a member that was mid-way into blocking when its process ended stays on the futex for good, and
holds the process's space until its region is destroyed.

Expected to fail: "a member stranded killed on a futex was never finished".

